Parts of cmd are adapted from baa by Selvi Arora (https://github.com/selviarora/baa),
used under the MIT License below:

- Sources/Health/Mem.swift, Procs.swift, Engine.swift, Disk.swift, Health.swift and Monitor.swift:
  RAM readings, process scanning, leftover detection, freeing, dev-junk cleanup, warning levels
  and notifications
- GUIInstance (the single-instance check) in Sources/App.swift
- Bar and Spark (the bar and sparkline views) in Sources/UI/Components.swift
- The Mac tab layout in Sources/UI/MacTab.swift
- build.sh and install.sh

Everything else in cmd is original, including Sources/Health/Demo.swift.

